{"ref":"BDB, חָֽרָבָה","hw":"חָֽרָבָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָֽרָבָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. dry ground</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:22\" href=\"/Genesis.7.22\">Gn 7:22</a> + 7 times; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַיָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 14:21\" href=\"/Exodus.14.21\">Ex 14:21</a> (J). <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:6\" href=\"/Haggai.2.6\">Hg 2:6</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:22\" href=\"/Genesis.7.22\">Gn 7:22</a> (J); opp. water of Jordan <a data-ref=\"Joshua 3:17\" href=\"/Joshua.3.17\">Jos 3:17</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (J), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:18\" href=\"/Joshua.4.18\">4:18</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"II Kings 2:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.2.8\">2 K 2:8</a>; of Nile-arms <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנָתַתִּ֫י יְאֹרִים ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.12\">Ez 30:12</a>.","next":"BDB, חֵרָבוֹן","prev":"BDB, חֹ֫רֶב"}